# Conformance probe pack for the `cdr` wire (spec 0.43), XCDR version 1: no
# group, a `default`, and a last member of one byte, so the body length is not
# a multiple of 4 and the trailing padding count `p` is not zero.
format          conformance-cdr-tail
version         0.43.0
distribution    public
source          "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses            probe
wire            cdr
cdr             1
representation  0001

field    probe.y      uint32
field    probe.n      int16
default  probe.n      5
field    uid          string
field    probe.x      uint8
